Added the ``DERIVED`` property parameter from :rfc:`9073#section-5.3` (Event Publishing Extensions to iCalendar). It is available on anyproperty (such as :class:`~icalendar.prop.text.vText`) to mark that its value is computed from other properties and must not be edited directly.I used Claude AI (Sonnet 5.5) to assist me with this change.@Mrbozz